    // 🎫️ ticket 26/08/17/MICROKERNEL-POOLED-ACTOR-PLUGIN-RUNTIME packet A3-kernel-types: `RequestId`
    // is the completion-correlation id every `req`-carrying `Effect` variant now needs at its call
